# src/apps/android/app/src/test

## Purpose
Defines the local JVM unit-test source set for the LumiNet Android application module.

## Contents
Contains the Java/Kotlin package hierarchy and host-side tests that do not require an Android device runtime.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Discovered by Gradle's unit-test source set and compiled against application code plus configured test libraries/mocks.

## Invariants
Code here is test-only, must not ship in application artifacts, and tests should avoid undeclared device/environment dependencies so they remain reproducible.